(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[21] = {"n": 21, "title": "Words with Multiple Functions", "ar": "وُجُوهُ الكَلِمَاتِ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>Learn to identify a word's function from its construction, then justify its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل، محل،</span> and ending. This module brings together familiar rules and less common uses of the same forms. English explains the distinctions; Arabic supplies the grammatical names.</p><p>Recall <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم وفعل وحرف؛ معرب ومبني؛ فاعل ومفعول به؛ مبتدأ وخبر؛ إضافة؛ صلة الموصول وعائده؛ شرط وجواب؛</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل من الإعراب</span>, but a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مبني</span> or a whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> may have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> can supply a grammatical role; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span> cannot replace that role. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم الأفعال الخمسة</span> appears as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span>.</p><p>For each new example: read the intended meaning, identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>, classify the word, then assign roles and endings. A rare use is included for recognition, not for unrestricted imitation. Where there is more than one recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحليل</span>, the exercise names the account or asks which qualification must be preserved. Every choice or table row has one correct answer.</p><p>Work through the guided examples first. In independent work, attempt <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> before opening the choices. Later passages reduce vowel marks and English support; use the endings and relationships together.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة وأم وبل</span>: read the relationship", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>A familiar spelling can perform several functions. First read the meaning and what follows; then decide whether the word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم، فعل،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجه</span></b> here means a grammatical use; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span></b> is the evidence that selects it.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Word</th><th>Function and example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نداء القريب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أزيدُ، أقبلْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخالدٌ حاضرٌ؟</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة مصدرية للتسوية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سواءٌ عليَّ أحضرتَ أم غبتَ</span></b>: your coming and absence are equal to me</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متصلة معادلة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخالدٌ عندك أم سعيدٌ؟</span></b> asks which one; after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة التسوية</span> it joins the two alternatives</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقطعة، ابتدائية: انتقال</span> to another statement or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>; it may carry <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنكار</span> according to context</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم</span></td><td>A recognised dialect uses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امـ</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أداة التعريف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امصيام</span></b>. Recognise this use; ordinary exercises use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span></td><td>Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد: حرف عطف،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تطلبْ حرامًا بل حلالًا</span></b>. Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة: حرف ابتداء،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما غاب خالدٌ، بل حضرَ</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المتصلة</span> is also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معادل</span></b>. The use joining two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة التسوية</span> is called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم التسوية</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضراب إبطالي</span></b> cancels an earlier claim; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضراب انتقالي</span></b> moves to a new point without cancelling the earlier one. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> allows both; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المنقطعة</span> expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتقال</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبطال</span>. A new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> introduced by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل الابتدائية</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> here, even though its meaning connects to the previous words. Context can even supply an omitted claim that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> then cancels; do not decide <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبطال</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتقال</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> alone.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخالدٌ حاضرٌ أم سعيدٌ؟</span></b> <span class=\"gl\">Is Khalid present, or Said?</span></div><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة حرف استفهام؛ خالد مبتدأ مرفوع؛ حاضر خبر مرفوع؛ أم حرف عطف متصلة؛ سعيد معطوف على خالد مرفوع</span>. The requested answer names one person. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سواءٌ عليَّ أحضر خالدٌ أم غاب</span></b>: no answer naming one alternative is requested; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة مصدرية للتسوية</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المتصلة تطلب التعيين بعد همزة الاستفهام، وتفيد التسوية بعد الهمزة المصدرية</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التعيين</span> = specifying which alternative.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أزيدُ، اقتربْ</span></b> the speaker calls someone nearby. Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ للنداء القريب؛ زيد منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> supplies the context.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Match the intended meaning: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سواء عليّ أبقيتَ أم رحلتَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The two alternatives are equal to the speaker. This is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسوية</span>, not a request to choose an answer.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة مصدرية للتسوية؛ أم متصلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة للاستفهام عن شخص؛ أم منقطعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهمزة للنداء؛ أم للتعريف</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the ending: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تشترِ قلمًا بل كتابـ</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل حرف عطف؛ كتاب معطوف على قلم، منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is shared by the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Someone says “Khalid did not arrive” and then corrects that claim: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل وصلَ</span></b>. Which reading fits?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل</span> introduces a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> and cancels the previous claim. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل فعل ماض؛ فاعله مستتر هو؛ الجملة لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل تعطف وصل على خالد بوصفه اسمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل ابتدائية للإضراب الإبطالي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بل حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which evidence distinguishes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أخالد أم سعيد؟</span></b> from a use of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المنقطعة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The request to identify one of the alternatives establishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المتصلة المعادلة</span>. A spelling alone is insufficient.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود اسم علم وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود حرف مبني وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب تعيين أحد المذكورين</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الانتقال لا يستلزم إبطال الكلام السابق</span></b> means:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انتقال</span> changes the point under discussion; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبطال</span> rejects the previous claim. Keep these distinct.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمكن الانتقال إلى غرض آخر مع بقاء الكلام السابق صحيحًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب تكذيب كل كلام سابق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم المنقطعة حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ وإذا ومذ ومنذ</span>: time and construction", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Core rule and terms</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> added to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلية</span>. Its common use is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول فيه</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span>, but a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span> can give it a future reference. After <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذكر</span></b> it can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذكر</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر</span>. It can also be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span>, as when a time is recalled within a preceding recollection. Further uses are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التعليل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفاجأة</span> after <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بينا / بينما</span></b>. In the last use there is an analysis as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> and another as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>; identify the stated account when doing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اذكرْ إذ كنتَ صغيرًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ في محل نصب مفعول به؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واذكر في الكتاب مريم إذ انتبذت من أهلها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ بدل من مريم</span> in the analysis of recalling her situation<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُه إذ ساعدني</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ للتعليل</span>, because he helped me. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بينما نحن جلوس إذ حضر رجلٌ</span></b> illustrates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفاجأة</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الظرفية</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مضاف إلى جملة فعلية</span>. The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is commonly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> in form, but may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>. Reference can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي، الحال،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المستقبل</span>; the future use may also carry <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span>, commonly after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>, and conveys a sudden situation in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحال</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ فإذا المطرُ شديدٌ</span></b>. It has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. A further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> use introduces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> in place of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>, while retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفاجأة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وإن تصبهم سيئةٌ ... إذا هم يقنطون</span></b>.</p><p>Do not supply a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> merely because you see <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span>. After <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى الابتدائية</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> may express time without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>; on other analyses a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span> is understood. Context may also supply an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> or the event to which the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غاية</span> relates.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيتُه منذُ يومِ الجمعةِ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منذ حرف جر؛ يوم اسم مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عرفتُه مذْ أنا يافعٌ</span></b> (since I was young)</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ اسم ظرف مضاف؛ الجملة بعدها في محل جر بالإضافة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منذ</span> admit both types: inspect whether what follows is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا حضرَ المعلّمُ أنصتْ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا ظرف لما يستقبل متضمّن معنى الشرط، مضاف؛ حضر فعل ماض؛ المعلّم فاعل مرفوع؛ جملة حضر المعلّم في محل جر بالإضافة. أنصت فعل أمر، فاعله مستتر أنت؛ جملته جواب شرط غير جازم لا محل لها</span>. The form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> does not make the event past here.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الفجائية تختص بالجملة الاسمية، والظرفية تضاف إلى الجملة الفعلية</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تختص</span> = is restricted to.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Core rule and terms"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحتُ البابَ فإذا الضيفُ واقفٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> describes a sudden situation: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضيف مبتدأ، واقف خبر. إذا هنا فجائية</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للضيف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مفاجأة لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما رأيتُه منذُ يومـ… الجمعةِ</span></b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منذ الجارّة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منذ حرف جر؛ يوم مجرور بالكسرة ومضاف؛ الجمعة مضاف إليه مجرور</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يومُ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا وصل المسافر فأكرمه</span></b>, arrival is expected tomorrow. What does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل</span> establish?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> form can follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا الظرفية</span> with future meaning. The context establishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استقبال</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن إذا حرف مفاجأة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض في اللفظ مع استقبال المعنى هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقوع الوصول أمس حتمًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ أنا صغيرٌ</span></b>, choose the analysis based on the complete following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا مبتدأ وصغير خبر؛</span> the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بالإضافة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ الاسمية</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ اسم ظرف مضاف إلى جملة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذ حرف جر وصغير مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا مضاف إليه مفرد مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A temporal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى</span> has no expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>. What is the sound first step?", "sol": "<p>The mere occurrence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> does not force an overt <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>. Its actual temporal or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> construction matters.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">افحص هل هي ظرفية محضة أو جوابها مقدّر بحسب السياق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجعل كل إذا حرف نداء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احكم بأن كل جملة كهذه خطأ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تضاف إذ إلى الجملة الاسمية والفعلية</span></b> allows:", "sol": "<p>Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة اسمية</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية</span> can complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة إذ</span>. Its role in the larger construction still needs analysis.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ خالدٍ فقط بلا خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ خالدٌ حاضرٌ، وإذ حضر خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ حرف جر في كل استعمال</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ وأنْ وإمّا</span>: similar forms, different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span> separate from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنّ</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكنة نون</span> does not by itself establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Uses and clues</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ تنجحْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن هذا إلا بشرٌ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخففة من الثقيلة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ خالدٌ لقائمٌ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما إنْ حضر خالدٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد أن أتعلمَ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفسرة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى القول</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشرتُ إليه أنِ اجلسْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخففة من الثقيلة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم أن سيكونُ</span>...</b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلمّا أن جاءَ</span>...</b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الشرطية</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الزائدة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا تذهبْ</span>...</b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> frequently follows in this use, but is not obligatory</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا ... وإمّا</span></td><td>Introduces alternatives: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خذ إمّا هذا وإمّا ذاك</span></b>. It is called <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span> in one account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفصيل</span> in another; the latter account assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا بمعنى إلا</span> often helps identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن النافية</span>, but is not compulsory. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام الفارقة</span></b> helps distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن المخففة</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن النافية. أن المفسرة</span> explains preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى القول</span> without forming a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن المصدرية</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> normally requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن المخففة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم أن سيكونُ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم أن ضمير شأن محذوف، والجملة خبرها</span>. With repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفصيل</span> account is supported by the entering <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>: it avoids treating both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span> as independent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف عطف</span> at the same point.</p><p>Only context licenses a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يبيّن الله لكم أن تضلّوا</span></b>, one analysis understands <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألّا تضلّوا</span></b>; another understands <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كراهةَ أن تضلّوا</span></b>. Do not insert <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> into every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> construction.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ أن أتعلّمَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد فعل مضارع مرفوع، فاعله مستتر أنا؛ أن حرف مصدري ناصب؛ أتعلّم مضارع منصوب بالفتحة، فاعله مستتر أنا؛ المصدر المؤول من أن والفعل في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشرت إليه أن اجلس</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن مفسرة، واجلس فعل أمر،</span> so there is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> to make <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن النافية لا تجزم، وأن المفسرة لا تنصب مضارعًا على أنها مصدرية</span>.</b> Decide which use exists before assigning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the function of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ تجتهدْ تنجحْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن شرطية تجزم فعل الشرط وجوابه: تجتهد وتنجح مجزومان بالسكون</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي مهمل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحبّ أن أقرأ</span>…</b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن المصدرية</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن المصدرية تنصب المضارع؛ أقرأ منصوب بالفتحة، والمصدر المؤول مفعول به لأحبّ</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأُ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Classify <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ هذا إلا خبرٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The meaning is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا إلا خبر. إن نافية؛ هذا مبتدأ، خبر خبر مرفوع؛ إلا للحصر</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطية جازمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفصيل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A signal means “sit down”: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أشرت إليه أن اجلس</span></b>. Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> explains the instruction conveyed by the signal. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجلس فعل أمر؛</span> this is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن المفسرة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معنى القول</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية ناصبة للمضارع هنا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تفصيل</span> account of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا هذا وإمّا ذاك</span></b>, what carries <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>?", "sol": "<p>This question specifies the account: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا للتفصيل والواو للعطف</span>. Another account calls <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا حرف عطف</span>; it is not being tested here.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الشرطية المحذوفة وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام فارقة بين إن المخففة والنافية</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن خالدٌ لقائمٌ</span></b> supports:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام الفارقة</span> signals the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجب مخففة</span> reading. The construction must be read as a whole.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن نافية هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن مخففة من الثقيلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن حرف نداء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل وأيّ وذا وذو: اسم</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>?", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Core rule and terms</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span></b> is usually <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تعريف</span>. In an account treating it as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span></b>, it occurs with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فاعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفعول</span> expressing a renewed event: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضارب، المضروب</span></b>. This account excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبالغة، صفة مشبهة، اسم تفضيل</span> in their meanings of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت</span>. Do not label every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل موصولة</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل الزائدة اللازمة</span></b> stays in particular forms, including <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللات، العزّى، الذي</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل الزائدة غير اللازمة</span></b> can occur with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم منقول عن صفة</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاسم، العبّاس</span></b>, for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفخيم</span> or recalling its original meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span> does not mean that it is always removable or has no effect on meaning.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Word</th><th>Uses</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيَّ كتابٍ تقرأْ تستفدْ منه</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّهم حضر؟</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دلالة الكمال،</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ أيُّ فتىً</span>!</b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصلة لنداء ما فيه أل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا أيّها الإنسانُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ أيّ هي المنادى، وها للتنبيه، والإنسان تابع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا كتابٌ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ اسم موصول</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> in the split analysis <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى صاحب</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ ذو علمٍ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول بمعنى الذي</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استعمال طيّئ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is normally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصولة</span> construction <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيُّهم أشدُّ</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر الصلة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّهم هو أشدّ</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>. A separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهامية</span> analysis is possible in a suitable larger construction; an earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّق</span>, with the question filling its required position. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل قلبي</span> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم</span>, an interrogative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> can <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سدّ مسدّ مفعولين</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأت؟</span></b>, one account takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا</span> together as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>. Another splits <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مبتدأ</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذا موصول خبر</span></b>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر عائد: قرأتَه</span>. State the account. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو بمعنى صاحب</span> enables a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> using a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جنس</span>; its relation of possessing a quality need not equal every companionship expressed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صاحب</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء رجلٌ ذو علمٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء فعل ماض؛ رجل فاعل مرفوع؛ ذو نعت مرفوع بالواو من الأسماء الستة، وهو مضاف؛ علم مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو الموصولة</span> in its dialectal use: it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>, not raised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالواو</span> under this analysis.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكون أيّ وصلة إلى نداء ما فيه أل، وتكون ذا موصولة في أحد تحليلي ماذا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصلة</span> = a means of reaching the construction.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Core rule and terms"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء رجل ذو فضلٍ</span></b>, choose the ending and role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل فاعل مرفوع؛ ذو نعت له، مرفوع بالواو ومضاف؛ فضل مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذي: فاعل مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو: نعت مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذا: مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under the split analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا قرأت؟</span></b>, what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذا</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مبتدأ؛ ذا اسم موصول في محل رفع خبر؛ قرأت صلة، والعائد مقدّر: قرأتَه</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول خبر لما</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا أيها الطالبُ</span></b>, identify the actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منادى</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب؛ ها للتنبيه؛ الطالب تابع مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالب وحده دون أيّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصولة</span> analysis, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّهم أشدّ</span></b> has omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>. Which description fits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافة</span> here and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صدر صلتها</span> omitted. Under this account it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> depends on the larger construction.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم مع الإضافة وحذف صدر الصلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Does calling <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> in a form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة لازمة</span> permit deleting it freely?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة لازمة</span> is a grammatical classification, not a general editing instruction. Recall <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي</span> and the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلام</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ كل زائد يحذف بلا قيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ ويصبح كل اسم فعلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا؛ اللازمة تبقى في تلك الصيغة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو بمعنى صاحب ملازمة للإضافة</span></b> predicts:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مضاف إليه</span>. Its own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> varies with its role; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو علمٌ بلا إضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذوٌ علمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذو علمٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي وأيْ ونعم وكلا وقد</span>: meaning supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span></b> can express <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعلام</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>, or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وعد</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب. إي</span> is restricted to a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي وربي</span></b>. It is stronger than <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجل</span></b> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span> use and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span></b> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعلام</span> use. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> does not require <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلم نافع: نعم</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل فهمت؟: نعم</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعلام</span>), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اطلب العلم: نعم</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وعد</span>). Keep <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَعَمْ</span></b> separate from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعْمَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل المدح</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيْ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكنة ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف: نداء القريب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفسير</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفردوس، أيِ الجنّة</span></b>. It is different from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاسمية</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشددة ياء</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Word</th><th>Meaning in context</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ردع وزجر</span>: restraining or rebuking; also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفتاح</span> in other contexts</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توقع</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يخرج زيدٌ</span></b>, an expected event; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقليل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يصدق الكذوب</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكثير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد نرى تقلّب وجهك في السماء</span></b>, with repeated occurrence intended</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحقيق</span>, commonly with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span>, but possible with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يعلم الله</span></b>. Do not assign <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقليل</span> here</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقريب</span>, as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد قامت الصلاة</span></b>: presenting the event as close to the present</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The same surface pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span></b> supports several meanings. Read the surrounding sense before selecting one. Similarly, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span> does not invariably reject the preceding words.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يصدقُ الكذوبُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد حرف تقليل</span> in the intended sense “even the habitual liar sometimes speaks truth”; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصدق فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة؛ الكذوب فاعل مرفوع. قد</span> has not made the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم للتصديق بعد الخبر، وللإعلام بعد الاستفهام، وللوعد بعد الطلب</span>.</b> These labels concern the speech to which the reply responds.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Someone asks <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحضر خالد؟</span></b> and receives <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span></b>. Which function fits?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span> answers a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> here, so its function is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعلام</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span> after a statement and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وعد</span> after a request.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعلام بعد استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وعد بعد طلب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which completion supplies the required environment for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي</span> is used before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم: الواو حرف قسم، رب اسم مجرور ومضاف، والياء مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي وربي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي فقط دون قسم في الاستعمال المدروس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إي كتابًا على أنها حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الروضة، أي البستان</span></b> the second word explains the first. Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أي</span>.", "sol": "<p>The explanatory use is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيْ المخففة</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ الاسمية</span>. The meaning is “that is, the garden”.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ اسم شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ منادى هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيْ حرف تفسير</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A passage explicitly says an event happened many times. Which meaning of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> fits that context?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد</span> can express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكثير</span> with supporting context. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> form alone does not prove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقليل</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التقليل حتمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التكثير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النصب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the claim “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا</span> always means <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ردع وزجر</span>.”", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ردع وزجر</span> is one use; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصديق</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفتاح</span> are also recognised. Select by context.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا فعل ماض دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأتي أيضًا للتصديق أو الاستفتاح بحسب السياق</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلا اسم شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد لا تغيّر رفع المضارع بنفسها</span></b> fits:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد ليست ناصبة ولا جازمة؛ ينجح مرفوع بالضمة</span> when no other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> changes that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حكم</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد ينجحْ الطالبُ بسبب قد وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد ينجحَ الطالبُ بسبب قد وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد ينجحُ الطالبُ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء والكاف</span>: distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>An attached letter can be part of a word's formation, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. First isolate it correctly.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span></th><th>Example and function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاللهِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للقسم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تؤمنُ</span></b>: initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> helps form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحنابلة</span></b>: the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> has this use</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خطاب</span></td><td>Final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتَ</span></b>, on the account <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ ضمير</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء خطاب</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمة</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قامتْ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قامت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف، لا محل له</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير بارز</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمنتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في محل رفع فاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رُبَّتَ، ثُمَّتَ</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثَمَّتَ</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>). Another account calls these <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لات</span> also admits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحليل لا</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span></b> other accounts treat the whole form as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, or assign the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>. Questions using the split account will say so. Do not confuse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثُمّ</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثَمّ</span></b>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></th><th>Example and function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تشبيه</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كالأسد</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعليل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كما هداكم</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبادرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّم كما تدخل</span></b> (greet as soon as you enter)</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّاك</span></b> on the account <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّا ضمير والكاف للخطاب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عليكم أنفسكم</span></b> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span> use; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرأيتك</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى أخبرني</span> on the account that gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم بمعنى مثل</span></td><td>An admitted analysis in such expressions as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كهيئة الطير</span></b>. Name this account when choosing it</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُكَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل؛ الكاف ضمير مبني على الفتح في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قامتْ هندٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء حرف تأنيث ساكن لا محل له، وهند هي الفاعل</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث حرف، وتاء الفاعل ضمير له محل من الإعراب</span>.</b> The same written letter does not guarantee the same function.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتْ هندٌ</span></b> to its function.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند فاعل مرفوع؛ التاء الساكنة للتأنيث، وليست الفاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b>, what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>?", "sol": "<p>The speaker is represented by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل المبنية على الضم. كتب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون لاتصاله بها</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مضارعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث ساكن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ كتابَكَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مفعول به منصوب ومضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه في محل جر. تعلّق</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> establishes this relationship.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تشبيه يجر كتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّا ضمير والكاف حرف خطاب</span></b>, what <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إياك</span>?", "sol": "<p>This specified analysis assigns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إيّا</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خطاب</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span>. Other analyses are not being silently rejected.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به وحدها</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correct ending with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء القسم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تالله</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء القسم حرف جر؛ لفظ الجلالة مجرور بالكسرة</span>. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة تأنيث</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاللهُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاللهِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاللهَ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف قد تكون ضميرًا منصوبًا أو مجرورًا</span></b> matches:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمك</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاف في محل نصب مفعول به؛ كتابك</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاف في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلكَ وحدها في تحليل حرف الخطاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمكَ وكتابكَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كالأسد وحدها</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون والياء: ضمير، علامة،</span> or added sound?", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Core rule and prerequisites</h2><p>Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مكتوب</span></b> from a sound at the end of a word. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنوين</span></b> is a pronounced <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون ساكنة زائدة</span>, written with the appropriate doubled mark: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلن</span>. It is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span></th><th>Function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النساء يكتبْنَ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثقيلة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكتبنَّ</span></b> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خفيفة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكتبنْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>. The special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رسم</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنسفعًا</span></b> represents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الخفيفة</span>, not ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية</span></td><td>Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمني</span></b>. It protects the preceding form from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>; it is not itself the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In the account used here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية</span> is required with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل، اسم الفعل، ليت، من، عن</span></b>; allowed with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ، أنّ، لكنّ، كأنّ</span></b>; and not added to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّ</span></b>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّي / إنّني</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّي</span></b>. It is therefore not confined to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span></th><th>Function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر المثنّى ومجموع المذكّر السالم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر الأسماء الستة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت معلّمَيْنِ؛ مررت بمعلّمينَ؛ بأبيك</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطبة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشكريه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء في محل رفع فاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متكلم</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ربّي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمني</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إشباع</span></td><td>Lengthening a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>, as the additional <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> in the recognised form <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطعتِيه</span></b>; it is not a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> letters belong to the original word. These tables describe particular added functions, not a licence to detach every such letter.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمني خالدٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرم فعل ماض مبني على الفتح؛ النون للوقاية لا محل لها؛ الياء ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشكريه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اشكر فعل أمر مبني على حذف النون؛ ياء المخاطبة فاعل؛ الهاء مفعول به</span>. Decide whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> represents before assigning its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية لا محل لها، وياء المتكلم في أكرمني مفعول به</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوقاية</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> are separate elements.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Core rule and prerequisites"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعانني أخي</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون للوقاية؛ ياء المتكلم مفعول به. أخي فاعل مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة، وهو مضاف والياء مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين مكتوب بحرف ن</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which form fits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّ</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span> in the rule taught here?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية</span> is not inserted with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّ</span> in this account; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء اسم لعلّ في محل نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لعلّين</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبي الدرسَ</span></b>, analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب فعل أمر مبني على حذف النون؛ ياء المخاطبة فاعل</span>. It is different from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمني</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطبة في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء متكلم في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بطالبينِ</span></b>, two students are intended. What is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبين اسم مجرور بالباء وعلامة جره الياء لأنه مثنّى؛ النون عوض عن التنوين في المفرد</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء إشباع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which comparison preserves the permitted choice with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span>?", "sol": "<p>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ, نون الوقاية</span> is allowed rather than compulsory in the account taught. Both forms retain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّي وإنّني جائزان هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّي فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّني ممتنع دائمًا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التنوين نون تلفظ ولا تكتب نونًا</span></b> selects:", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> sound of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> is represented by the doubled mark. It is not an added written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو والفاء</span>: link, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>?", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>Inspect both sides of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span>. Do not treat every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> or every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> as a cause of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></th><th>Example and clue</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استئناف</span></td><td>Opens a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> rather than giving it a role within the preceding one</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر خالدٌ وسعيدٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حال</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يضحك</span></b>: the accompanying state</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ والنهرَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهر مفعول معه؛</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> in the required construction <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأن مضمرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تأكلِ السمكَ وتشربَ اللبنَ</span></b> (do not combine them)</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى ربّ</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وليلٍ</span>...</b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> after it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in this recognised construction</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span></td><td>An analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ربّنا ولك الحمد</span></b> assigns this function to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير رفع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمنوا، يؤمنون</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبوك، المعلّمون</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إشباع</span></td><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متصل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتموه، أنلزمكموها</span></b>. It is not an extra <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span></b> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاطفة، مستأنفة،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب شرط</span>. It can also link a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه شرط</span></b> to what follows: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهد فله جائزة</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span> construction carries a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> sense. A preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span> can also carry such a sense: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وفي ذلك فليتنافس المتنافسون</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الشرط</span> is also called <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>; this name does not remove the connection in meaning.</p><p>Recall <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء السببية: نصب المضارع</span> after the required preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب</span> belongs to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن مضمرة</span></b>, not to every written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>. Distinguish its construction from a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> followed by a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب جملة</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ وهو يضحكُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء فعل ماض؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع؛ الواو للحال؛ هو مبتدأ؛ يضحك مضارع مرفوع وفاعله مستتر هو؛ جملة يضحك في محل رفع خبر؛ جملة هو يضحك في محل نصب حال</span>. Contrast <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالد وسعيد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيد اسم معطوف مرفوع</span>, not a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة حالية</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة ضمير، وواو جمع المذكّر السالم علامة رفع</span>.</b> Both occur at word endings, but only the first supplies a participant in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> to its role.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبوا</span> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة فاعل؛ المعلّمون مبتدأ مرفوع بالواو؛ والله</span> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو القسم الجارّة</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع اسم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمون حاضرون: الواو في المعلّمون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الحال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل للفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للقسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الإشباع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The intended meaning is walking alongside the river: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سرتُ والنهر</span>…</b>. Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المفعول معه</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو للمعية؛ النهر مفعول معه منصوب بالفتحة، لا معطوف مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهرِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النهرُ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دخل الطفل وهو يبتسم</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما محل جملة هو يبتسم؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو للحال؛ هو مبتدأ؛ يبتسم وفاعله المستتر جملة في محل رفع خبر؛ الجملة الاسمية كلها حال</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب حال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يجتهدْ فله مكافأةٌ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما وظيفة الفاء؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط جملة اسمية: له خبر مقدّم، مكافأة مبتدأ مؤخّر. الفاء تربطها بالشرط؛ الجملة في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للمكافأة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب الشرط</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتموه</span></b> is identified here as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إشباع</span>. Does it introduce another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> lengthens the sound after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميم</span>. The existing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير رفع</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتم</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء مفعول به</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ الهاء تصير مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم؛ كل واو فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا؛ هي لإشباع الضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء رابطة لشبه الشرط</span></b> fits the account of:", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span> construction has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> meaning. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span> links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> to that meaning, and may also be called <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span> in this use.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابك جديد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي يجتهد فله جائزة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاز الطالب بلا فاء رابطة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى وكي واللام</span>: identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى</span></b> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر، حرف عطف،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استئناف</span>. Compare the deliberately different constructions:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Example</th><th>Analysis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكلت السمكةَ حتى رأسِها</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى حرف جر؛ رأس مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكلت السمكةَ حتى رأسَها</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى عاطفة؛ رأس معطوف منصوب</span></td></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكلت السمكةَ حتى رأسُها مأكولٌ</span></b></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى ابتدائية؛ رأس مبتدأ ومأكول خبر</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Before a future <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> in its governing use, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى</span> enters on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن مضمرة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتظرُ حتى يحضرَ خالدٌ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بأن</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر المؤول</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بحتى</span>. Context distinguishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غاية</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعليل. حتى الابتدائية</span> may precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلية</span>, with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>. Recall that temporal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span> after it need not have an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كي</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية ناصبة</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لكي تتعلّمَ</span></b>. Its rare use as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> appears in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيمَهْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كي</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاستفهامية</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف ألف ما</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت</span>. This is for recognition.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">The uses of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example or clue</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لخالدٍ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام التعليل</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر وطلب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> commonly <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكنة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَلْيكتبْ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابتداء، مزحلقة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَخالدٌ صادقٌ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن خالدًا لَصادقٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب لو، لولا،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو حضر لأكرمتُه</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موطئة للقسم، مؤذنة</span></td><td>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَئِنْ</span>...</b> it signals <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>, which may be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُعد</span></td><td>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك، تلك</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فارقة</span></td><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن المخففة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن خالدٌ لقائمٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جحود</span></td><td>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي كان</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كان خالدٌ ليكذبَ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ أن مضمرة تنصب المضارع</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَلْيكتبْ خالدٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء بحسب ما قبلها؛ اللام لام الأمر، حرف جازم؛ يكتب مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جئتُ لأكتبَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام للتعليل والجر؛ أن مضمرة تنصب أكتب؛ المصدر المؤول مجرور باللام. حركة المضارع</span> follows the actual construction.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر تجزم، ولام الجحود يضمر بعدها أن</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يضمر</span> = is understood without being written.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "The uses of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the endings to the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى</span> construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجر</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى الجارّة؛ النصب</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عطف</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السمكةَ؛ الرفع</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى الابتدائية</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى الجارّة: حتى رأسها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسَها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسُها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسِها</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى العاطفة على السمكةَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسُها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسِها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسَها</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى الابتدائية: حتى رأسها مأكولٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسُها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسَها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأسِها</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the form after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِـ… خالدٌ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر تجزم المضارع؛ يقرأ مجزوم بالسكون وخالد فاعل مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقرأْ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كان سعيدٌ ليكذب</span>…</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بلام الجحود</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجحود</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي كان. المضارع منصوب بأن مضمرة، لا مجزوم بلام الأمر</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكذبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكذبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكذبَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سأنتظر حتى يصلَ القطارُ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما الناصب ليصل؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى حرف جر والمصدر المؤول مجرور بها؛ أن مضمرة هي الناصبة للمضارع، والقطار فاعل مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى بوصفها لام أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن مضمرة بعد حتى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القطار</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> is a sign of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُعد</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذلك</span> contains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام البعد وكاف الخطاب</span>. Do not give it the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجر</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span>.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام في لِيكتبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام في ذلك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام في لخالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كي في كيمه حرف جر</span></b> implies the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيمه</span> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كي الجارّة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاستفهامية</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء السكت؛ ألف ما محذوفة</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاستفهامية حذفت ألفها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية الناصبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما ضمير رفع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ولمّا وليس: نفي, نهي</span>, or another use?", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>Do not identify a word's <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> from a translation such as “not”. Read its construction.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></th><th>Example and effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية للجنس</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلَ في الدار</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها وخبرها</span> have their established <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحكام</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مشبهة بليس</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا رجلٌ حاضرًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمها مرفوع وخبرها منصوب</span> in this use</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية للمضارع</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يكذبُ خالدٌ</span></b>: no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية للماضي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعاء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا قدّر اللهُ</span></b>; repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلا صدّق ولا صلّى</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكذبْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم المضارع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عاطفة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ لا سعيدٌ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل حضر؟ لا</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span></td><td>A recognised contextual use for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توكيد</span>; do not delete every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>. An analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لئلا يعلم ... ألا يقدرون</span></b> relates it to the reinforced <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span></b> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان</span> carrying a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> meaning: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا حضر أكرمتُه</span></b>. Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> it can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يحضرْ</span></b> = he has not arrived yet. It also comes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى إلا</span>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ كلُّ نفسٍ لمّا عليها حافظٌ</span></b> on this reading.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس</span></b> is usually <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ناقص</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس خالدٌ غائبًا</span></b>. It can express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القوم ليس زيدًا</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ اسمها ضمير مستتر وخبرها زيدًا</span>. In the analysis treating it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي مهمل</span> before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلية</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس يعلم الغيبَ إلا اللهُ</span></b>, it does not assign a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم وخبر</span>. Questions will explicitly select that account.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ الضيفُ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا حرف نفي وجزم؛ يصل مضارع مجزوم بالسكون؛ الضيف فاعل مرفوع</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا وصل الضيفُ أكرمتُه</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل ماض،</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف</span>; it has not made <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل مجزوم</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية تجزم، ولا النافية لا تجزم المضارع</span>.</b> Identify whether the speaker forbids an action or reports its absence.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The speaker forbids lying: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكذب</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ناهية تجزم المضارع بالسكون</span>. A report that someone does not lie would use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكذبُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكذبَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكذبْ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس المسافرُ متعبـ</span>…</b> using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس الناقصة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافر اسم ليس مرفوع؛ متعب خبر ليس منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متعبٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا ينتهِ الدرسُ</span></b> means the lesson has not yet ended. Which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا جازمة هنا؛ ينته مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة، والكسرة دليل على الياء المحذوفة؛ الدرس فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف مضاف إلى جملة ماضية هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف بمعنى إلا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس يعلم الغيبَ إلا اللهُ</span></b>, identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس حرف نفي مهمل</span> here<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ يعلم فعل مضارع؛ الغيب مفعول به؛ إلا للحصر؛ الله فاعل مرفوع</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع ليعلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ليس منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ليس على هذا التحليل</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the ending after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا العاطفة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر سعيدٌ لا خالد</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد معطوف على سعيد، فيتبعه في الرفع. لا هنا عاطفة لا نافية للجنس</span>.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا تكون بمعنى إلا</span></b> matches the intended reading of:", "sol": "<p>The first construction has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن النافية ولمّا بمعنى إلا</span>. The other two are the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازمة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظرفية</span> uses.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن كل نفس لمّا عليها حافظ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا يصلْ الضيف بمعنى لم يصل بعد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا حضر أكرمته</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو ولولا وعسى: شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجاء</span>", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو</span></b> is not confined to one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> meaning.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example and intended meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو حضرتَ لأكرمتُك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امتناع الجواب لامتناع الشرط</span> in this use</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمنّي</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو أنّ لنا كرّةً</span></b>: wishing for another return</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عرض</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو تنزلُ عندنا</span></b>: a gentle invitation to stay</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وددتُ لو حضرتَ</span></b>: I wished for your attendance</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقليل</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصدّقْ ولو بشقّ تمرةٍ</span></b>: even a small amount</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا الشرطية</span></b> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمية</span> expresses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امتناع لوجود</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا الماءُ لهلك الزرعُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماء مبتدأ، وخبره مقدّر</span> here: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موجود</span>. The existence of water prevents the indicated outcome. With a past action <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span> may express <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توبيخ</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا صلّيتَ</span></b> rebukes a missed action. With an action being urged it expresses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحضيض</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا تصلّي</span></b>. It can also precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذ، إذا،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span>; inspect the whole construction rather than only the next word.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل جامد</span>. As <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقصة</span></b>, it has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم وخبر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى خالدٌ أن يحضرَ</span></b>. As <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّة</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span> is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى أن يحضرَ خالدٌ</span></b>. Move through the actual word order before assigning the roles.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى خالدٌ أن يحضرَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى فعل ماض جامد ناقص مبني على فتح مقدّر؛ خالد اسم عسى مرفوع؛ أن حرف مصدري ناصب؛ يحضر مضارع منصوب، فاعله مستتر هو؛ المصدر المؤول في محل نصب خبر عسى</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى أن يحضرَ خالدٌ</span>.</b> On the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّة</span> analysis: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى فعل ماض جامد تام؛ خالد فاعل يحضر؛ المصدر المؤول من أن يحضر خالد في محل رفع فاعل عسى</span>. Do not supply a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عسى</span> in this account.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا لامتناع الجواب لوجود الشرط، ولو لامتناعه لامتناعه في الاستعمال الشرطي المدروس</span>.</b> Track what exists and what consequently does not occur.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا الماءُ لهلك الزرعُ</span></b>, what prevents the destruction?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا</span> expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امتناع الهلاك لوجود الماء. الماء مبتدأ وخبره مقدّر: موجود</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امتناع الماء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود الماء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كون الماء مفعولًا به</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى الناقصة</span>, analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى خالدٌ أن يفوزَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى ناقصة؛ خالد اسمها؛ المصدر المؤول من أن يفوز خبرها في محل نصب؛ فاعل يفوز مستتر هو</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل يفوز ظاهر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم عسى مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى التامّة</span>, what role does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يصلَ الضيفُ</span></b> have in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى أن يصلَ الضيفُ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى تامّة تكتفي بفاعل؛ المصدر المؤول فاعلها، والضيف فاعل يصل داخل ذلك التركيب</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر عسى في محل نصب في هذا التحليل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول في محل رفع فاعل عسى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A speaker regrets a missed past prayer and says <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا صلّيتَ</span></b>. Which use?", "sol": "<p>The past action is being reproached, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لولا للتوبيخ</span>. Context distinguishes it from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحضيض</span> for an action still being urged.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امتناع لوجود اسم بعدها هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">توبيخ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وددتُ لو زرتَنا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو</span> is explicitly read as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span>. What does it yield?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لو المصدرية</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> conveys the wished-for visit. It is not a request to construct a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط وجواب</span> here.</p>", "group": "11R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول بمعنى زيارتك لنا</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى فعل جامد</span></b> means:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمود</span> concerns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصرّف الصيغة</span>. It does not prevent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عسى</span> from being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناقصة</span> in the given constructions.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجر الاسم بعده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتصرّف تصرّف الأفعال المعتاد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس فعلًا في أي استعمال</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "12", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير وحاشا وخلا وعدا: إضافة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>", "short": "Lesson 12", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ملازم للإضافة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شديد الإبهام</span>. Adding a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span> does not automatically give it the ordinary effect of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span>. In the account used here it can be <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بدل</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span>. It also expresses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span></b>, and can convey <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لكن</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو مجتهد، غير أنّه متعب</span></b>. Its own ending follows its role; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا</span></b> has more than the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> use:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example and analysis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر للتنزيه</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا اللهِ / حاشا للهِ</span></b>: on this account <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر منصوب على المفعول المطلق لفعل محذوف</span>; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is linked by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر للاستثناء</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساء القومُ حاشا زيدٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td>Form variation</td><td>Final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> may be omitted: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشَ</span></b>. An alternative account treats <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشَ</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> use expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنزيه</span>; contexts also carry <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعجّب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قسم</span>. Choose an account explicitly before supplying its detailed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا وعدا</span></b> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلين ماضيين</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفي جر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القوم ما خلا زيدًا</span></b> fixes the verbal use: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا فعل ماض، فاعله مستتر، زيد مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القوم خلا زيدٍ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خلا الجارّة</span>. The same contrast applies to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدا</span>. Without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>, do not assume that only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> is possible: the selected construction and ending decide. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا / ما عدا</span></b> in these examples, use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> analysis.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القومُ غيرَ زيدٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر فعل ماض؛ القوم فاعل مرفوع؛ غير منصوب على الاستثناء في هذا الكلام التام الموجب، وهو مضاف؛ زيد مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما حضر غيرُ زيدٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير فاعل مرفوع</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرّغ</span> construction. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيد</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in both.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير تأخذ إعرابها بحسب موقعها، وما بعدها مضاف إليه مجرور</span>.</b> Separate the two endings.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L12-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L12-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L12-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "12G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القومُ غيرَ سعيد</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير مضاف؛ سعيد مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> does not pass to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "12G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the ending with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عدا</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر القوم ما عدا خالد</span>…</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عدا</span> fixes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> analysis here: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدا فعل ماض، فاعله مستتر؛ خالد مفعول به منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "12I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر تحليل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما وصل غيرُ مسافرٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>This is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء مفرّغ؛ غير</span> takes the needed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> role after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل، ومسافر مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستثنى منصوب وجوبًا هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "12I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the analysis explicitly treating <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا</span></b> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر للتنزيه</span>.", "sol": "<p>The named account gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا</span> the role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> accounts concern other uses or alternative analyses.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر في هذا التحليل نفسه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق لفعل محذوف</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "12R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساء القوم حاشا خالدٍ</span></b>, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا الجارّة</span>, why is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مجرور</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حاشا حرف جر للاستثناء؛ خالد اسم مجرور بها</span>. Contrast the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> account and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "12R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحاشا حرف الجر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأنه فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأنه خبر ليس</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "12-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير لا تتعرّف بمجرد إضافتها إلى معرفة</span></b> warns against:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متوغّلة في الإبهام</span>. Do not mechanically transfer the usual result of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> into every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span> construction.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر المضاف إليه بعد غير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتبار كل غير مضافة إلى معرفة معرفة حتمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعطاء غير أي موقع إعرابي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "13", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاسمية</span>: establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>", "short": "Lesson 13", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L13-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>When <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>, identify its meaning and its role in the larger construction. Being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> does not prevent a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل من الإعراب</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example and diagnostic</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصولة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجبني ما صنعتَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الذي صنعته؛</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> has an expressed or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر عائد</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تفعلْ من خيرٍ تجدْه</span></b>: introduces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط وجواب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهامية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عندك؟</span></b>: requests an answer</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة تامّة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعِمّا هي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما بمعنى الشيء</span> on this account</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة بمعنى شيء</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بما نافعٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما نكرة موصوفة بنافع</span>; the category admits a complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span> use and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصوفة</span> use</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت لنكرة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خذ كتابًا ما</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما نكرة موصوف بها</span>, making the choice <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرفية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فما استقاموا لكم فاستقيموا لهم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى ما داموا</span>. In this account it is included among <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الاسمية</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة تامّة</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة تامّة</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تامّة</span> means that no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> is required to complete a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span>; it does not mean that the entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is finished. For the last use follow the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرفية</span> account when analysing, rather than assuming that every time-related <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> must receive the same classification as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span> in the next lesson.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L13-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجبني ما صنعتَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجب فعل ماض؛ النون للوقاية؛ الياء مفعول به؛ ما اسم موصول مبني على السكون في محل رفع فاعل؛ صنعت فعل ماض وتاء فاعل؛ جملة صنعت صلة الموصول لا محل لها؛ العائد محذوف، تقديره صنعتَه</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> that links the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> matters even when unwritten.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L13-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الموصولة تحتاج إلى صلة وعائد، وما التامّة لا تحتاج إلى صلة</span>.</b> The distinction is structural, not merely a translation choice.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L13-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L13-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L13-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "13G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما عندك؟</span></b>, the speaker is asking what someone has. Classify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>.", "sol": "<p>The question requests information. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما اسم استفهام في محل رفع مبتدأ؛ عندك ظرف متعلق بخبر</span>.</p>", "group": "13G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "13G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصولة</span> analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحببتُ ما كتبتَ</span></b>, supply the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مفعول به لأحببت؛ كتبت صلة؛ تقدير العائد الهاء في كتبتَه، يعود إلى ما</span>.</p>", "group": "13G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كتبتُ أنا بلا عائد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كتبتَه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما كتبتَهم مع مرجع مفرد هنا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "13I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تزرعْ تحصدْه</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما الدليل على ما الشرطية؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تزرع وتحصد مضارعان مجزومان؛ ما اسم شرط في محل نصب مفعول به لتزرع، والهاء تعود إليه في الجواب</span>.</p>", "group": "13I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كون تحصد فعلًا ماضيًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ارتباط فعل الشرط بجوابه مع الجزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود ما وحدها فقط</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "13I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The intended meaning is “take some book, whichever”: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خذ كتابًا ما</span></b>. Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما نعت للنكرة كتابًا في هذا الاستخدام؛ محلها نصب تبعًا لمنعوتها</span>.</p>", "group": "13I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول يحتاج صلة محذوفة وجوبًا هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوف بها في محل نصب نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ينفي خذ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "13R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "For <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجبني ما صنعت</span></b> under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الموصولة</span>, what is its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعجب فعل؛ الياء مفعول به؛ ما</span> is what caused the admiration, so it occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل. البناء</span> does not remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p>", "group": "13R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بحرف جر ظاهر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل لها لأنها مبنية</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "13-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما معرفة تامّة بمعنى الشيء</span></b> is the stated account for:", "sol": "<p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِعِمّا هي</span>, this analysis takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة تامة بمعنى الشيء</span>. It is distinct from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الشرطية في ما تفعل تجدْه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما النافية في ما حضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما في نِعِمّا هي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "14", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الحرفية: نفي، مصدر، كفّ،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة</span>", "short": "Lesson 14", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L14-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الحرفية</span></b> does not itself have the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span> construction the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span></b> can have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; do not confuse that with giving the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> alone a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Use</th><th>Example and effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نافية</span></td><td>Before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسمية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا؛ ما حضر خالدٌ</span></b>. In the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تعمل عمل ليس</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضاقت عليهم الأرض بما رحبت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بما رحبت = برُحبها</span>; the meaning is the event or quality, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كافّة</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّما خالدٌ حاضرٌ</span></b>: blocks the usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كافّة بعد فعل</span></td><td><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّما يفعل ذلك، طالما انتظرت</span></b>: on this account it stops the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب فاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span></td><td>Can follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر، اسم شرط،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فبما رحمةٍ؛ أيّما؛ إمّا</span></b></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كفّ</span></b> means stopping the usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span> or demand of what precedes. In a separate analysis of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّما</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر مؤول</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل قلّ</span>. Neither account should be confused with assigning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> to a bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة</span>. Questions specify the account.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>, inspect what remains operative: in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فبما رحمةٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> still gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رحمة</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إمّا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة</span>. The label does not instruct you to remove a word from an established expression.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L14-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّما خالدٌ حاضرٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ حرف مكفوف عن العمل بما؛ ما كافّة؛ خالد مبتدأ مرفوع؛ حاضر خبر مرفوع</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ خالدًا حاضرٌ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد اسم إن منصوب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما حضر خالدٌ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما نافية، حضر فعل ماض، خالد فاعل مرفوع</span>: there is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> to be stopped from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L14-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية تؤول مع ما بعدها بمصدر، وما الكافّة تكفّ ما قبلها عن العمل</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تؤول</span> = is interpreted as an equivalent construction.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L14-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L14-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L14-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "14G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّما المسافر… حاضرٌ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكف إنّ عن العمل؛ المسافر مبتدأ مرفوع، حاضر خبر</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ المسافرَ حاضرٌ</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة</span>.</p>", "group": "14G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافرِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المسافرُ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "14G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما هذا بشرًا</span></b>, using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما العاملة عمل ليس</span>, what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشرًا</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا اسم ما في محل رفع؛ بشرًا خبرها منصوب بالفتحة. ما هنا نافية عاملة عمل ليس</span>.</p>", "group": "14G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر ما منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "14I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فبما رحمةٍ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span> is specified as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>. What governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رحمة</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الزائدة</span> does not cancel <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر الباء؛ رحمة اسم مجرور بالباء</span>.</p>", "group": "14I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء الناصبة للأسماء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما بوصفها فعلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء الجارّة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "14I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Under <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما مصدرية</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّما</span>, what supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل قلّ</span>?", "sol": "<p>This is the alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span> account. On the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كافّة</span> account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّ</span> is stopped from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب فاعل</span> instead.</p>", "group": "14I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطبة محذوف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المصدر المؤول من ما وما بعدها</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "14R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the distinction between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الموصولة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span>.", "sol": "<p>Look for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة وعائد</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصولة</span> construction and an event-equivalent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدر</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصدرية</span> construction. Their translations alone can resemble one another.</p>", "group": "14R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما تجزمان فعلين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلتاهما حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموصولة اسم له صلة وعائد؛ المصدرية حرف يؤول مع ما بعده بمصدر</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "14-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما تكفّ إنّ عن العمل</span></b> explains why:", "sol": "<p>After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنما</span> in this account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع؛ حاضر خبر مرفوع</span>. No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إن منصوب</span> remains.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مرفوع في إنما خالد حاضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد منصوب في إنما خالد حاضر بهذا التحليل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنما فعل ماض</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "15", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من ومتى وكيف وكم</span>: read from the role outward", "short": "Lesson 15", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L15-s1\">Core rule</h2><p>All four forms in this lesson are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> in the uses below. Distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مِن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجارّة</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Word</th><th>Uses and examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط للعاقل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يجتهدْ ينجحْ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موصول</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ من حضرَ</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من حضر؟</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة موصوفة بمعنى شخص</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بمن معجبٍ لك</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسافر؟</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تسافرْ أسافرْ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف حالك؟</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> in the account practised here: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف تجلسْ أجلسْ</span></b></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهامية</span> asking a quantity: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابًا قرأت؟</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرية</span> reporting a large quantity: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابٍ قرأتُ</span>!</b></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز كم</span></b>: in the ordinary patterns practised here it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد منصوب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الاستفهامية</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم الخبرية</span>. Learn the permitted variations in their own constructions; do not turn these ordinary patterns into a ban on every other form.</p><p>Being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط، اسم استفهام،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span> identifies the word's kind; it does not finish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>. Ask what role the surrounding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> requires. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن الموصولة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الموصولة</span>, identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عائد</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>, locate both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب الشرط</span>. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>, distinguish its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> from the ending of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L15-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابًا قرأتَ؟</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم اسم استفهام مبني على السكون في محل نصب مفعول به مقدّم؛ كتابًا تمييز منصوب؛ قرأ فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابٍ قرأتُ</span>!</b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم خبرية في محل نصب مفعول به،</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز مجرور. كم</span> did not change its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> merely because its following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> changed.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L15-s3\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نوع الكلمة غير موقعها: من قد تكون موصولة، ثم يبيّن التركيب محلّها من الإعراب</span>.</b> Now use the Arabic labels directly in your analysis.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L15-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L15-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L15-s3", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "15G-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Match <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن</span></b> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ من ساعدني</span></b> to its use.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن بمعنى الذي، في محل نصب مفعول به؛ ساعدني صلة، وفاعله المستتر هو يعود إلى مَن</span>.</p>", "group": "15G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "15G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "For an ordinary question asking how many: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم كتابـ… قرأتَ؟</span></b>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم استفهامية؛ كتابًا تمييز مفرد منصوب</span> in this pattern. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم نفسها مفعول به مقدّم في محل نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "15G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٌ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "15I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى تصلْ أستقبلْك</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، اختر تحليل متى</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متى اسم شرط في محل نصب ظرف زمان؛ تصل فعل الشرط وأستقبل جوابه، كلاهما مجزوم بالسكون</span>.</p>", "group": "15I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استفهام لا يجزم هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط يدل على الزمان</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "15I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف تجلسْ أجلسْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسب التحليل المدروس، كيف هي</span>:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف شرطية في هذا الاستعمال؛ تجلس فعل الشرط وأجلس جوابه</span>. This is the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي</span> account.</p>", "group": "15I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما المصدرية</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "15R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A reader reports many visits, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم زيارةٍ زرتُه</span>!</b> Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كم خبرية تفيد التكثير؛ زيارة تمييز مجرور</span> in the given pattern. The supplied meaning distinguishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>.</p>", "group": "15R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبرية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهامية تطلب العدد هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "15-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن نكرة موصوفة بمعنى شخص</span></b> corresponds to the stated analysis of:", "sol": "<p>In the first expression <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَن</span> means a person, described by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معجبٍ لك</span>. The other two uses are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من يجتهدْ ينجحْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من حضر؟ على الاستفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بمن معجبٍ لك</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Begin with the relationships; then justify every ending. In connected passages, track the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر</span> across <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the ending under each stated construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية تجزم، والنافية لا تجزم؛ بعد لام الجحود أن مضمرة تنصب؛ ما الكافّة تمنع عمل إنّ فيبقى خالد مبتدأ مرفوعًا</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي: لا تهمل… الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملُ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفي مجرد: لا يهمل… خالدٌ الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يهملُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يهملْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يهملَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الجحود: ما كان ليهمل</span>…", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليهملَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليهملُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليهملْ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما الكافّة: إنما خالد… مجتهدٌ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the ending while preserving <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما خلا</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل الضيوف ما خلا سعيدٍ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع ما خلا، خلا فعل ماض وفاعله مستتر، وسعيد مفعول به منصوب</span>. Without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>, a specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> account could give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سعيدٍ</span>, but that is not this task.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل الضيوف ما خلا سعيدٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل الضيوف ما خلا سعيدًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصل الضيوف ما خلا سعيدٍ بلا تغيير</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت فإذا صديقي واقف. قال: هل قرأت ما أعطيتك؟ قلت: نعم، وقد فهمته</span>.</b> Analyse the selected elements.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا فجائية؛ صديقي مبتدأ مرفوع بضمة مقدرة، والياء مضاف إليه؛ واقف خبر. ما موصولة مفعول به لقرأت؛ أعطيتك صلة، والتاء فاعل، والكاف مفعول به أول، والعائد المحذوف مفعول به ثان: أعطيتكه. نعم جواب سؤال للإعلام. في فهمته: التاء فاعل والهاء مفعول به يعود إلى ما أعطي</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إذا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مفاجأة قبل جملة اسمية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما: على الموصولية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إذا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي بلا محل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب مفعول به لقرأت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف في أعطيتك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب بلا محل هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به أول</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جواب للإعلام بعد استفهام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مدح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا حضر المعلّم قال: لا تكتبوا حتى تفهموا. إنما العلم نافع لمن يعمل به</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر التحليل</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا ظرف مرتبط بحضور المعلّم؛ حضر فعل ماض لا مجزوم. تكتبوا مجزوم بلا الناهية، وتفهموا منصوب بأن مضمرة بعد حتى؛ كلاهما يحذف نون الأفعال الخمسة ولكن العامل مختلف. الواو فيهما فاعل. إنما: إن مكفوفة، العلم مبتدأ، نافع خبر. مَن موصولة مجرورة باللام؛ يعمل به صلة، وفاعله المستتر يعود إلى مَن، والهاء في به تعود إلى العلم</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمّا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جزم يجزم حضر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان قبل فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى إلا هنا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ناهية؛ تكتبوا مجزوم بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا نافية؛ تكتبوا مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حتى تفهموا: فهم متوقّع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهموا منصوب بأن مضمرة وحذف النون علامته</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهموا مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تفهموا مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لمن يعمل به: مَن موصولة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب اسم إن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن تجتهدْ فأنتَ ناجحٌ</span>.</b> Use the account <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ ضمير</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء خطاب</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن شرطية جازمة؛ تجتهد فعل الشرط مجزوم وفاعله مستتر أنت. الفاء رابطة؛ على التحليل المعين أنْ ضمير مبتدأ والتاء للخطاب، وناجح خبر. جواب الشرط جملة اسمية مقترنة بالفاء في محل جزم</span>. This split of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span> is an explicitly selected account, not a rejection of the whole-form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> account.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجتهد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم شرط مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وفاعله تاء ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم بالسكون وفاعله مستتر أنت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رابطة لجواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب بنفسه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ في أنت وفق التحليل المحدّد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مصدري ناصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير منفصل في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في أنت وفق التحليل المحدّد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث ساكن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف خطاب لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء فاعل في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إن منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة أنت ناجح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلة لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جزم جواب الشرط المقترن بالفاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما حضر غيرُ معلّمَيْنِ</span>.</b> Exactly two teachers are intended.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الاستثناء مفرّغ؛ غير تأخذ موقع الفاعل بعد حضر. معلّمَيْن مضاف إليه مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى؛ نونه باقية لأن معلّمَيْن نفسه ليس مضافًا. كون غير مضافًا لا يحذف نون المضاف إليه. الجملة ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف استثناء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَيْن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون في معلّمَيْن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الوقاية قبل ياء المتكلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون المثنّى وليست ضميرًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميّز الاسم والحرف والضمير والعلامة بحسب التحليل المصرّح به</span>.", "sol": "<p>Distinguish the word or letter from the construction it forms. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو رفع الجمع</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة. ما المصدرية حرف، لكن المصدر المؤول له محل. ما الموصولة اسم له محل بحسب موقعه</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو المعلّمون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف حال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو يكتبون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو قسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الاسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما في بما رحبت: مصدرية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم موصول وعائده واجب هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف والمصدر المؤول مجرور بالباء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مخاطب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما في ما كتبتَ: موصولة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم له صلة وعائد مقدّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي حتمًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner chooses one analysis where more than one is admitted. What makes a single-answer exercise sound?", "sol": "<p>Context and a named account prevent unfair ambiguity: compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماذا, أيّ, قلّما, حاشا</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنت</span>. Explain the alternatives, then analyse the selected construction consistently.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف كل مثال فيه حرف مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اعتبار كل تحليل آخر خطأ بلا قيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحديد السياق والتحليل المقصود قبل طلب الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 2}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>Read the whole construction before naming the function. State the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرينة, العامل</span>, and any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span>. Where analyses differ, name the account you are using.</p>"}], "revisit": ""};
